  "remarks": "\n  Admiral Group is an involved person under the Iran (Sanctions) Regulations 2023 on the basis of the following ground: Admiral Group has provided support to hostile activity by the Government of Iran, namely activity which is intended to cause the destabilisation of the United Kingdom or any other country.\n  \n",
